ConversationRecord.description_en:
The conversation record. The structure is a JSON array in which entries are sorted by time. Example:

```json
[
    {
        "content":"Conversation content",
        "role":"Role", // Valid values: user, assistant
    }
]
```

ConversationRecord.description_zh:
聊天记录信息。结构为JSON数组，聊天记录时按照时间顺序已经排序好了。具体如下：
```json
[
    {
        "content":"聊天内容",
        "role":"角色",//可取值：user（用户）、assistant（机器人）
    }
]
```

